      "path": "/projects/ionic-angular-collect-icons/docs/initialize",
      "html": "<p data-line=\"0\" class=\"code-line\"><a href=\"/ja/projects/ionic-angular-collect-icons/docs/readme#%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB\">インストール</a> のあとで <code>addIcons</code> を配線します。<a href=\"/ja/projects/ionic-angular-collect-icons/docs/usage\">使い方</a> も見てください。</p>\n<h3 id=\"%E8%87%AA%E5%8B%95%E8%A8%AD%E5%AE%9A\" data-line=\"2\" class=\"code-line\"><a class=\"header-anchor-link\" href=\"#%E8%87%AA%E5%8B%95%E8%A8%AD%E5%AE%9A\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a> 自動設定</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block-container\"><pre class=\"shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#151e2c;color:#e1e4e8\"><code class=\"code-line\" data-line=\"4\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> @rdlabo/ionic-angular-collect-icons</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> --initialize</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p data-line=\"8\" class=\"code-line\"><code>src/use-icons.ts</code> と、<code>main.ts</code> / <code>app.config.ts</code> への <code>addIcons</code> 登録を確認してください。</p>\n<h3 id=\"%E6%89%8B%E5%8B%95%E8%A8%AD%E5%AE%9A\" data-line=\"10\" class=\"code-line\"><a class=\"header-anchor-link\" href=\"#%E6%89%8B%E5%8B%95%E8%A8%AD%E5%AE%9A\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a> 手動設定</h3>\n<h4 id=\"1.-cli-%E3%82%92%E5%AE%9F%E8%A1%8C%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B\" data-line=\"12\" class=\"code-line\"><a class=\"header-anchor-link\" href=\"#1.-cli-%E3%82%92%E5%AE%9F%E8%A1%8C%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a> 1. CLI を実行する</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block-container\"><pre class=\"shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#151e2c;color:#e1e4e8\"><code class=\"code-line\" data-line=\"14\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> @rdlabo/ionic-angular-collect-icons</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre></div><p data-line=\"18\" class=\"code-line\">これで <code>src/use-icons.ts</code> が生成されます。</p>\n<h4 id=\"2.-%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E3%81%95%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9F%E3%83%95%E3%82%A1%E3%82%A4%E3%83%AB%E3%82%92-main.ts%EF%BC%88%E3%81%BE%E3%81%9F%E3%81%AF-app.config.ts%EF%BC%89%E3%81%A7%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%83%9D%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%3A\" data-line=\"20\" class=\"code-line\"><a class=\"header-anchor-link\" href=\"#2.-%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E3%81%95%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9F%E3%83%95%E3%82%A1%E3%82%A4%E3%83%AB%E3%82%92-main.ts%EF%BC%88%E3%81%BE%E3%81%9F%E3%81%AF-app.config.ts%EF%BC%89%E3%81%A7%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%83%9D%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%3A\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a> 2. 生成されたファイルを <code>main.ts</code>（または <code>app.config.ts</code>）でインポートする:</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block-container\"><pre class=\"shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#151e2c;color:#e1e4e8\"><code class=\"code-line\" data-line=\"22\"><span class=\"line diff add\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\">+</span><span> import { addIcons } from 'ionicons';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line diff add\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\">+</span><span> import * as allIcons from 'ionicons/icons';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line diff add\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\">+</span><span> import * as useIcons from './use-icons';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\"> </span><span> if (environment.production) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\"> </span><span>   enableProdMode();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\"> </span><span> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line diff add\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\">+</span><span>  addIcons(environment.production ? useIcons : allIcons);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"3.-%E3%82%AF%E3%83%A9%E3%82%B9%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%A9%E3%82%AF%E3%82%BF%E5%86%85%E3%81%AE%E4%BB%96%E3%81%AE-addicons-%E5%91%BC%E3%81%B3%E5%87%BA%E3%81%97%E3%82%92%E5%89%8A%E9%99%A4%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B\" data-line=\"34\" class=\"code-line\"><a class=\"header-anchor-link\" href=\"#3.-%E3%82%AF%E3%83%A9%E3%82%B9%E3%82%B3%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%A9%E3%82%AF%E3%82%BF%E5%86%85%E3%81%AE%E4%BB%96%E3%81%AE-addicons-%E5%91%BC%E3%81%B3%E5%87%BA%E3%81%97%E3%82%92%E5%89%8A%E9%99%A4%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a> 3. クラスコンストラクタ内の他の <code>addIcons</code> 呼び出しを削除する</h4>\n<div class=\"code-block-container\"><pre class=\"shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#151e2c;color:#e1e4e8\"><code class=\"code-line\" data-line=\"36\"><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\"> </span><span> @Component(/* ... */)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\"> </span><span> export class ExampleComponent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\"> </span><span>   constructor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line diff remove\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\">-</span><span>     addIcons(useIcons);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\"> </span><span>   }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"diff-prefix\"> </span><span> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span></code></pre></div>",
